<title>UK: Glaxo sees 1997 profit margin at 35 pct.</title>
<headline>Glaxo sees 1997 profit margin at 35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>British drugs group Glaxo Wellcome Plc predicted on Thursday that full-year profit margins would slip to around 35.0 percent from 37.5 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>Previously the group had predicted full-year margins of around 35.5 percent, but finance director John Coombe told a news conference that sterling's strength had caused him to revise this estimate.</p>
</text>
